ompression_ratio": 1.6679245283018869, "no_speech_prob": 0.14601895213127136}, {"id": 37, "seek": 8790, "start": 116.24000000000001, "end": 117.2, "text": " What things?", "tokens": [51782, 708, 721, 30, 51830], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.209074357969571, "compression_ratio": 1.6679245283018869, "no_speech_prob": 0.14601895213127136}, {"id": 38, "seek": 11790, "start": 117.9, "end": 119.22, "text": " And they said to him,", "tokens": [50365, 400, 436, 848, 281, 796, 11, 50431], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13867126431381493, "compression_ratio": 1.5802919708029197, "no_speech_prob": 2.3006927222013474e-05}, {"id": 39, "seek": 11790, "start": 119.92, "end": 126.80000000000001, "text": " Concerning Jesus of Nazareth, a man who was a prophet mighty in deed and word before God and all the people,", "tokens": [50466, 2656, 1776, 773, 2705, 295, 11870, 40414, 11, 257, 587, 567, 390, 257, 18566, 21556, 294, 30299, 293, 1349, 949, 1265, 293, 439, 264, 561, 11, 50810], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13867126431381493, "compression_ratio": 1.5802919708029197, "no_speech_prob": 2.3006927222013474e-05}, {"id": 40, "seek": 11790, "start": 127.26, "end": 132.92000000000002, "text": " and how our chief priests and rulers delivered him up to be condemned to death and crucified him.", "tokens": [50833, 293, 577, 527, 9588, 27192, 293, 35009, 10144, 796, 493, 281, 312, 36472, 281, 2966, 293, 46846, 796, 13, 51116], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13867126431381493, "compression_ratio": 1.5802919708029197, "no_speech_prob": 2.3006927222013474e-05}, {"id": 41, "seek": 11790, "start": 133.6, "end": 136.82, "text": " But we had hoped that he was the one to redeem Israel.", "tokens": [51150, 583, 321, 632, 19737, 300, 415, 390, 264, 472, 281, 37715, 5674, 13, 51311], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13867126431381493, "compression_ratio": 1.5802919708029197, "no_speech_prob": 2.3006927222013474e-05}, {"id": 42, "seek": 11790, "start": 137.56, "end": 142.46, "text": " Yes, and besides all this, it is now the third day since these things happened.", "tokens": [51348, 1079, 11, 293, 11868, 439, 341, 11, 309, 307, 586, 264, 2636, 786, 1670, 613, 721, 2011, 13, 51593], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13867126431381493, "compression_ratio": 1.5802919708029197, "no_speech_prob": 2.3006927222013474e-05}, {"id": 43, "seek": 11790, "start": 143.24, "end": 146.4, "text": " Moreover, some women of our company amazed us.", "tokens": [51632, 19838, 11, 512, 2266, 295, 527, 2237, 20507, 505, 13, 51790], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13867126431381493, "compression_ratio": 1.5802919708029197, "no_speech_prob": 2.3006927222013474e-05}, {"id": 44, "seek": 11790, "start": 146.86, "end": 147.68, "text": " They were at the tomb.", "tokens": [51813, 814, 645, 412, 264, 18712, 13, 51854], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13867126431381493, "compression_ratio": 1.5802919708029197, "no_speech_prob": 2.3006927222013474e-05}, {"id": 45, "seek": 14768, "start": 147.68, "end": 151.48000000000002, "text": " They were at the tomb early in the morning, and when they did not find his body, they came back,", "tokens": [50365, 814, 645, 412, 264, 18712, 2440, 294, 264, 2446, 11, 293, 562, 436, 630, 406, 915, 702, 1772, 11, 436, 1361, 646, 11, 50555], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1876782695139487, "compression_ratio": 1.7127659574468086, "no_speech_prob": 0.000836038205306977}, {"id": 46, "seek": 14768, "start": 151.82, "end": 155.92000000000002, "text": " saying that they had even seen a vision of angels who said that he was alive.", "tokens": [50572, 1566, 300, 436, 632, 754, 1612, 257, 5201, 295, 18175, 567, 848, 300, 415, 390, 5465, 13, 50777], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1876782695139487, "compression_ratio": 1.7127659574468086, "no_speech_prob": 0.000836038205306977}, {"id": 47, "seek": 14768, "start": 156.44, "end": 160.70000000000002, "text": " Some of those who were with us went to the tomb and found it just as the women had said.", "tokens": [50803, 2188, 295, 729, 567, 645, 365, 505, 1437, 281, 264, 18712, 293, 1352, 309, 445, 382, 264, 2266, 632, 848, 13, 51016], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1876782695139487, "compression_ratio": 1.7127659574468086, "no_speech_prob": 0.000836038205306977}, {"id": 48, "seek": 14768, "start": 161.56, "end": 163.56, "text": " But him they did not see.", "tokens": [51059, 583, 796, 436, 630, 406, 536, 13, 51159], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1876782695139487, "compression_ratio": 1.7127659574468086, "no_speech_prob": 0.000836038205306977}, {"id": 49, "seek": 14768, "start": 164.26000000000002, "end": 165.28, "text": " And he said to them,", "tokens": [51194, 400, 415, 848, 281, 552, 11, 51245], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1876782695139487, "compression_ratio": 1.7127659574468086, "no_speech_prob": 0.000836038205306977}, {"id": 50, "seek": 14768, "start": 166.08, "end": 171.4, "text": " O foolish ones, and slow of heart to believe all that the prophets have spoken.", "tokens": [51285, 422, 23478, 2306, 11, 293, 2964, 295, 1917, 281, 1697, 439, 300, 264, 27297, 362, 10759, 13, 51551], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1876782695139487, "compression_ratio": 1.7127659574468086, "no_speech_prob": 0.000836038205306977}, {"id": 51, "seek": 14768, "start": 171.92000000000002, "end": 175.98000000000002, "text": " Was it not necessary that the Christ should suffer these things,", "tokens": [51577, 3027, 309, 406, 4818, 300, 264, 2040, 820, 9753, 613, 721, 11, 51780], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1876782695139487, "compression_ratio": 1.7127659574468086, "no_speech_prob": 0.000836038205306977}, {"id": 52, "seek": 14768, "start": 176.56, "end": 177.66, "text": " and enter into his kingdom,", "tokens": [51809, 293, 3242, 666, 702, 10231, 11, 51864], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1876782695139487, "compression_ratio": 1.7127659574468086, "no_speech_prob": 0.000836038205306977}, {"id": 53, "seek": 17766, "start": 177.66, "end": 178.14, "text": " and enter into his glory?", "tokens": [50365, 293, 3242, 666, 702, 11924, 30, 50389], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21631004626934344, "compression_ratio": 1.7338129496402879, "no_speech_prob": 0.0059558250941336155}, {"id": 54, "seek": 17766, "start": 178.96, "end": 181.34, "text": " And beginning with Moses and all the prophets,", "tokens": [50430, 400, 2863, 365, 17580, 293, 439, 264, 27297, 11, 50549], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21631004626934344, "compression_ratio": 1.7338129496402879, "no_speech_prob": 0.0059558250941336155}, {"id": 55, "seek": 17766, "start": 181.56, "end": 185.54, "text": " he interpreted to them in all the scriptures the things concerning himself.", "tokens": [50560, 415, 26749, 281, 552, 294, 439, 264, 29969, 264, 721, 18087, 3647, 13, 50759], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21631004626934344, "compression_ratio": 1.7338129496402879, "no_speech_prob": 0.0059558250941336155}, {"id": 56, "seek": 17766, "start": 186.16, "end": 188.82, "text": " So they drew near to the village to which they were going.", "tokens": [50790, 407, 436, 12804, 2651, 281, 264, 7288, 281, 597, 436, 645, 516, 13, 50923], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21631004626934344, "compression_ratio": 1.7338129496402879, "no_speech_prob": 0.0059558250941336155}, {"id": 57, "seek": 17766, "start": 189.51999999999998, "end": 191.74, "text": " He acted as if he were going farther.", "tokens": [50958, 634, 20359, 382, 498, 415, 645, 516, 20344, 13, 51069], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21631004626934344, "compression_ratio": 1.7338129496402879, "no_speech_prob": 0.0059558250941336155}, {"id": 58, "seek": 17766, "start": 192.48, "end": 194.51999999999998, "text": " But they urged him strongly, saying,", "tokens": [51106, 583, 436, 44206, 796, 10613, 11, 1566, 11, 51208], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21631004626934344, "compression_ratio": 1.7338129496402879, "no_speech_prob": 0.0059558250941336155}, {"id": 59, "seek": 17766, "start": 195.4, "end": 200.12, "text": " Stay with us, for it is toward evening, and the day is now far spent.", "tokens": [51252, 8691, 365, 505, 11, 337, 309, 307, 7361, 5634, 11, 293, 264, 786, 307, 586, 1400, 4418, 13, 51488], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21631004626934344, "compression_ratio": 1.7338129496402879, "no_speech_prob": 0.0059558250941336155}, {"id": 60, "seek": 17766, "start": 200.88, "end": 202.62, "text": " So he went in to stay with them.", "tokens": [51526, 407, 415, 1437, 294, 281, 1754, 365, 552, 13, 51613], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21631004626934344, "compression_ratio": 1.7338129496402879, "no_speech_prob": 0.0059558250941336155}, {"id": 61, "seek": 17766, "start": 203.32, "end": 207.04, "text": " When he was at table with them, he took the bread and blessed and broke it,", "tokens": [51648, 1133, 415, 390, 412, 3199, 365, 552, 11, 415, 1890, 264, 5961, 293, 12351, 293, 6902, 309, 11, 51834], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21631004626934344, "compression_ratio": 1.7338129496402879, "no_speech_prob": 0.0059558250941336155}, {"id": 62, "seek": 17766, "start": 207.04, "end": 207.64, "text": " and gave it to them.", "tokens": [51834, 293, 2729, 309, 281, 552, 13, 51864], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21631004626934344, "compression_ratio": 1.7338129496402879, "no_speech_prob": 0.0059558250941336155}, {"id": 63, "seek": 20766, "start": 207.66, "end": 211.26, "text": " And their eyes were opened, and they recognized him,", "tokens": [50365, 400, 641, 2575, 645, 5625, 11, 293, 436, 9823, 796, 11, 50545], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1639080047607422, "compression_ratio": 1.7743190661478598, "no_speech_prob": 0.0015009173657745123}, {"id": 64, "seek": 20766, "start": 211.35999999999999, "end": 212.74, "text": " and he vanished from their sight.", "tokens": [50550, 293, 415, 37518, 490, 641, 7860, 13, 50619], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1639080047607422, "compression_ratio": 1.7743190661478598, "no_speech_prob": 0.0015009173657745123}, {"id": 65, "seek": 20766, "start": 213.52, "end": 214.82, "text": " They said to each other,", "tokens": [50658, 814, 848, 281, 1184, 661, 11, 50723], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1639080047607422, "compression_ratio": 1.7743190661478598, "no_speech_prob": 0.0015009173657745123}, {"id": 66, "seek": 20766, "start": 215.5, "end": 219.3, "text": " Did not our hearts burn within us while he talked to us on the road,", "tokens": [50757, 2589, 406, 527, 8852, 5064, 1951, 505, 1339, 415, 2825, 281, 505, 322, 264, 3060, 11, 50947], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1639080047607422, "compression_ratio": 1.7743190661478598, "no_speech_prob": 0.0015009173657745123}, {"id": 67, "seek": 20766, "start": 219.88, "end": 222.01999999999998, "text": " while he opened to us the scriptures?", "tokens": [50976, 1339, 415, 5625, 281, 505, 264, 29969, 30, 51083], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1639080047607422, "compression_ratio": 1.7743190661478598, "no_speech_prob": 0.0015009173657745123}, {"id": 68, "seek": 20766, "start": 222.84, "end": 226.12, "text": " And they rose that same hour and returned to Jerusalem.", "tokens": [51124, 400, 436, 10895, 300, 912, 1773, 293, 8752, 281, 15393, 13, 51288], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1639080047607422, "compression_ratio": 1.7743190661478598, "no_speech_prob": 0.0015009173657745123}, {"id": 69, "seek": 20766, "start": 226.6, "end": 230.68, "text": " And they found the eleven and those who were with them gathered together, saying,", "tokens": [51312, 400, 436, 1352, 264, 21090, 293, 729, 567, 645, 365, 552, 13032, 1214, 11, 1566, 11, 51516], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1639080047607422, "compression_ratio": 1.7743190661478598, "no_speech_prob": 0.0015009173657745123}, {"id": 70, "seek": 20766, "start": 231.2, "end": 234.78, "text": " The Lord has risen indeed, and has appeared to Simon.", "tokens": [51542, 440, 3257, 575, 28614, 6451, 11, 293, 575, 8516, 281, 13193, 13, 51721], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1639080047607422, "compression_ratio": 1.7743190661478598, "no_speech_prob": 0.0015009173657745123}, {"id": 71, "seek": 20766, "start": 234.78, "end": 237.64, "text": " Then they told what had happened on the road,", "tokens": [51721, 1396, 436, 1907, 437, 632, 2011, 322, 264, 3060, 11, 51864], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1639080047607422, "compression_ratio": 1.7743190661478598, "no_speech_prob": 0.0015009173657745123}, {"id": 72, "seek": 23766, "start": 237.66, "end": 240.78, "text": " and how he was known to them in the breaking of the bread.", "tokens": [50365, 293, 577, 415, 390, 2570, 281, 552, 294, 264, 7697, 295, 264, 5961, 13, 50521], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.30123279940697456, "compression_ratio": 1.6733870967741935, "no_speech_prob": 0.0006666553090326488}, {"id": 73, "seek": 23766, "start": 241.32, "end": 243.24, "text": " As they were talking about these things,", "tokens": [50548, 1018, 436, 645, 1417, 466, 613, 721, 11, 50644], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.30123279940697456, "compression_ratio": 1.6733870967741935, "no_speech_prob": 0.0006666553090326488}, {"id": 74, "seek": 23766, "start": 243.74, "end": 247.07999999999998, "text": " Jesus himself stood among them, and said to them,", "tokens": [50669, 2705, 3647, 9371, 3654, 552, 11, 293, 848, 281, 552, 11, 50836], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.30123279940697456, "compression_ratio": 1.6733870967741935, "no_speech_prob": 0.0006666553090326488}, {"id": 75, "seek": 23766, "start": 247.5, "end": 248.94, "text": " Peace to you.", "tokens": [50857, 13204, 281, 291, 13, 50929], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.30123279940697456, "compression_ratio": 1.6733870967741935, "no_speech_prob": 0.0006666553090326488}, {"id": 76, "seek": 23766, "start": 249.57999999999998, "end": 252.72, "text": " But they were startled and frightened, and thought they saw a spirit.", "tokens": [50961, 583, 436, 645, 48898, 293, 28839, 11, 293, 1194, 436, 1866, 257, 3797, 13, 51118], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.30123279940697456, "compression_ratio": 1.6733870967741935, "no_speech_prob": 0.0006666553090326488}, {"id": 77, "seek": 23766, "start": 253.44, "end": 254.4, "text": " And he said to them,", "tokens": [51154, 400, 415, 848, 281, 552, 11, 51202], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.30123279940697456, "compression_ratio": 1.6733870967741935, "no_speech_prob": 0.0006666553090326488}, {"id": 78, "seek": 23766, "start": 255.07999999999998, "end": 256.18, "text": " Why are you troubled?", "tokens": [51236, 1545, 366, 291, 29402, 30, 51291], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.30123279940697456, "compression_ratio": 1.6733870967741935, "no_speech_prob": 0.0006666553090326488}, {"id": 79, "seek": 23766, "start": 256.82, "end": 259.36, "text": " And why do doubts arise in your hearts?", "tokens": [51323, 400, 983, 360, 22618, 20288, 294, 428, 8852, 30, 51450], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.30123279940697456, "compression_ratio": 1.6733870967741935, "no_speech_prob": 0.0006666553090326488}, {"id": 80, "seek": 23766, "start": 260.08, "end": 264.04, "text": " See my hands and my feet, that it is I myself.", "tokens": [51486, 3008, 452, 2377, 293, 452, 3521, 11, 300, 309, 307, 286, 2059, 13, 51684], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.30123279940697456, "compression_ratio": 1.6733870967741935, "no_speech_prob": 0.0006666553090326488}, {"id": 81, "seek": 23766, "start": 264.6, "end": 266.02, "text": " Touch me, and see.", "tokens": [51712, 20029, 385, 11, 293, 536, 13, 51783], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.30123279940697456, "compression_ratio": 1.6733870967741935, "no_speech_prob": 0.0006666553090326488}, {"id": 82, "seek": 23766, "start": 266.02, "end": 266.1, "text": " See.", "tokens": [51783, 3008, 13, 51787], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.30123279940697456, "compression_ratio": 1.6733870967741935, "no_speech_prob": 0.0006666553090326488}, {"id": 83, "seek": 23766, "start": 266.5, "end": 267.64, "text": " For a spirit does not know.", "tokens": [51807, 1171, 257, 3797, 775, 406, 458, 13, 51864], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.30123279940697456, "compression_ratio": 1.6733870967741935, "no_speech_prob": 0.0006666553090326488}, {"id": 84, "seek": 26766, "start": 267.66, "end": 270.86, "text": " A spirit does not have flesh and bones, as you see that I have.", "tokens": [50365, 316, 3797, 775, 406, 362, 12497, 293, 10491, 11, 382, 291, 536, 300, 286, 362, 13, 50525], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16839519766874092, "compression_ratio": 1.7389705882352942, "no_speech_prob": 0.02842424251139164}, {"id": 85, "seek": 26766, "start": 271.52000000000004, "end": 274.90000000000003, "text": " And when he had said this, he showed them his hands and his feet.", "tokens": [50558, 400, 562, 415, 632, 848, 341, 11, 415, 4712, 552, 702, 2377, 293, 702, 3521, 13, 50727], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16839519766874092, "compression_ratio": 1.7389705882352942, "no_speech_prob": 0.02842424251139164}, {"id": 86, "seek": 26766, "start": 275.46000000000004, "end": 279.88000000000005, "text": " And while they still disbelieved for joy and were marveling, he said to them,", "tokens": [50755, 400, 1339, 436, 920, 36105, 46515, 337, 6258, 293, 645, 23893, 278, 11, 415, 848, 281, 552, 11, 50976], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16839519766874092, "compression_ratio": 1.7389705882352942, "no_speech_prob": 0.02842424251139164}, {"id": 87, "seek": 26766, "start": 280.32000000000005, "end": 282.42, "text": " Have you anything here to eat?", "tokens": [50998, 3560, 291, 1340, 510, 281, 1862, 30, 51103], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16839519766874092, "compression_ratio": 1.7389705882352942, "no_speech_prob": 0.02842424251139164}, {"id": 88, "seek": 26766, "start": 283.04, "end": 287.24, "text": " They gave him a piece of broiled fish, and he took it and ate before them.", "tokens": [51134, 814, 2729, 796, 257, 2522, 295, 2006, 7292, 3506, 11, 293, 415, 1890, 309, 293, 8468, 949, 552, 13, 51344], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16839519766874092, "compression_ratio": 1.7389705882352942, "no_speech_prob": 0.02842424251139164}, {"id": 89, "seek": 26766, "start": 287.90000000000003, "end": 288.98, "text": " Then he said to them,", "tokens": [51377, 1396, 415, 848, 281, 552, 11, 51431], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16839519766874092, "compression_ratio": 1.7389705882352942, "no_speech_prob": 0.02842424251139164}, {"id": 90, "seek": 26766, "start": 289.82000000000005, "end": 293.34000000000003, "text": " These are my words that I spoke to you while I was still with you,", "tokens": [51473, 1981, 366, 452, 2283, 300, 286, 7179, 281, 291, 1339, 286, 390, 920, 365, 291, 11, 51649], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16839519766874092, "compression_ratio": 1.7389705882352942, "no_speech_prob": 0.02842424251139164}, {"id": 91, "seek": 26766, "start": 293.62, "end": 297.40000000000003, "text": " that everything written about me in the law of Moses and the prophets,", "tokens": [51663, 300, 1203, 3720, 466, 385, 294, 264, 2101, 295, 17580, 293, 264, 27297, 11, 51852], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16839519766874092, "compression_ratio": 1.7389705882352942, "no_speech_prob": 0.02842424251139164}, {"id": 92, "seek": 29766, "start": 297.66, "end": 299.76000000000005, "text": " and the Psalms must be fulfilled.", "tokens": [50365, 293, 264, 26150, 2592, 1633, 312, 21380, 13, 50470], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17320150799221462, "compression_ratio": 1.593984962406015, "no_speech_prob": 0.0022693071514368057}, {"id": 93, "seek": 29766, "start": 300.6, "end": 304.28000000000003, "text": " Then he opened their minds to understand the Scriptures, and said to them,", "tokens": [50512, 1396, 415, 5625, 641, 9634, 281, 1223, 264, 46522, 11, 293, 848, 281, 552, 11, 50696], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17320150799221462, "compression_ratio": 1.593984962406015, "no_speech_prob": 0.0022693071514368057}, {"id": 94, "seek": 29766, "start": 305.02000000000004, "end": 308.18, "text": " Thus it is written, that the Christ should suffer,", "tokens": [50733, 13827, 309, 307, 3720, 11, 300, 264, 2040, 820, 9753, 11, 50891], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17320150799221462, "compression_ratio": 1.593984962406015, "no_speech_prob": 0.0022693071514368057}, {"id": 95, "seek": 29766, "start": 308.52000000000004, "end": 310.98, "text": " and on the third day rise from the dead,", "tokens": [50908, 293, 322, 264, 2636, 786, 6272, 490, 264, 3116, 11, 51031], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17320150799221462, "compression_ratio": 1.593984962406015, "no_speech_prob": 0.0022693071514368057}, {"id": 96, "seek": 29766, "start": 311.38000000000005, "end": 315.58000000000004, "text": " and that repentance and forgiveness of sin should be proclaimed in his name", "tokens": [51051, 293, 300, 37593, 293, 18396, 295, 3343, 820, 312, 49091, 294, 702, 1315, 51261], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17320150799221462, "compression_ratio": 1.593984962406015, "no_speech_prob": 0.0022693071514368057}, {"id": 97, "seek": 29766, "start": 315.58000000000004, "end": 318.82000000000005, "text": " to all nations, beginning from Jerusalem.", "tokens": [51261, 281, 439, 11035, 11, 2863, 490, 15393, 13, 51423], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17320150799221462, "compression_ratio": 1.593984962406015, "no_speech_prob": 0.0022693071514368057}, {"id": 98, "seek": 29766, "start": 319.42, "end": 321.86, "text": " You are witnesses of these things.", "tokens": [51453, 509, 366, 20217, 295, 613, 721, 13, 51575], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17320150799221462, "compression_ratio": 1.593984962406015, "no_speech_prob": 0.0022693071514368057}, {"id": 99, "seek": 29766, "start": 321.86, "end": 326.64000000000004, "text": " And behold, I am sending the promise of my Father upon you.", "tokens": [51575, 400, 27234, 11, 286, 669, 7750, 264, 6228, 295, 452, 7085, 3564, 291, 13, 51814], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17320150799221462, "compression_ratio": 1.593984962406015, "no_speech_prob": 0.0022693071514368057}, {"id": 100, "seek": 29766, "start": 327.22, "end": 327.64000000000004, "text": " But still,", "tokens": [51843, 583, 920, 11, 51864], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17320150799221462, "compression_ratio": 1.593984962406015, "no_speech_prob": 0.0022693071514368057}, {"id": 101, "seek": 32766, "start": 327.66, "end": 331.04, "text": " stay in the city until you are clothed with power from on high.", "tokens": [50365, 1754, 294, 264, 2307, 1826, 291, 366, 13619, 292, 365, 1347, 490, 322, 1090, 13, 50534], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12545011183794808, "compression_ratio": 1.6105769230769231, "no_speech_prob": 0.0200183242559433}, {"id": 102, "seek": 32766, "start": 331.40000000000003, "end": 336.16, "text": " Then he led them out as far as Bethany, and lifting up his hands, he blessed them.", "tokens": [50552, 1396, 415, 4684, 552, 484, 382, 1400, 382, 14011, 1325, 11, 293, 15798, 493, 702, 2377, 11, 415, 12351, 552, 13, 50790], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12545011183794808, "compression_ratio": 1.6105769230769231, "no_speech_prob": 0.0200183242559433}, {"id": 103, "seek": 32766, "start": 337.04, "end": 340.88000000000005, "text": " While he blessed them, he parted from them and was carried up into heaven.", "tokens": [50834, 3987, 415, 12351, 552, 11, 415, 644, 292, 490, 552, 293, 390, 9094, 493, 666, 7162, 13, 51026], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12545011183794808, "compression_ratio": 1.6105769230769231, "no_speech_prob": 0.0200183242559433}, {"id": 104, "seek": 32766, "start": 341.6, "end": 345.5, "text": " And they worshipped him and returned to Jerusalem with great joy", "tokens": [51062, 400, 436, 35366, 5529, 796, 293, 8752, 281, 15393, 365, 869, 6258, 51257], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12545011183794808, "compression_ratio": 1.6105769230769231, "no_speech_prob": 0.0200183242559433}, {"id": 105, "seek": 32766, "start": 345.5, "end": 348.62, "text": " and were continually in the temple blessing God.", "tokens": [51257, 293, 645, 22277, 294, 264, 10184, 13869, 1265, 13, 51413], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12545011183794808, "compression_ratio": 1.6105769230769231, "no_speech_prob": 0.0200183242559433}], "language": "English"}